    "detailed_description": "Girl Gunner is a fun 2D shooter game with a rich weapon system, exquisite graphics, and beautiful BGM, especially bullets. Currently, there are up to 24 types! Players will play the cute girl Emily, escaping from the deserted island and breaking out of the siege.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers will fight against various enemies in this game, including robots, humanoids, turrets, and unknown creatures. Each game has a unique challenge, with the difficulty gradually increasing from simple to challenging. Players who enjoy horizontal 2D shooting, adventure, and challenges must not miss it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features:<br />\r\n1. The protagonist is a girl<br />\r\n2. Classic pixel style graphics<br />\r\n3. Rich weapons and weapon systems, with the ability to freely switch weapons. Currently, there are up to 24 types of weapons and bullets, making you exhilarating<br />\r\n4. The protagonist is no longer the type of female warrior who used to hang at a touch, but a female warrior with health value<br />\r\n5. The game has a secret script system, which can further reduce the difficulty of the game for players with average game proficiency<br />\r\n6. Rich levels and BGM allow you to relax and enjoy the joy of BGM",
